#. ja: コンテンツルーレット：レべリング
#. de: Zufallsinhalt: Stufensteigerung
#. fr: Mission aléatoire : gain de niveaux
#. column 1: Leveling
#. column 3: A dungeon or trial will be selected at random from among those you have unlocked. Successful completion will earn you far greater rewards.<br><br>※Bonus EXP and gil will be awarded to compensate for the discrepancy between character and duty levels. A further percentage will then be added based on character level.<br>※The amount of bonus company seals awarded is determined by class/job level.<br>※The standard reward for this duty roulette category and all related bonuses are available once per day. Reward eligibility resets at <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time) each day.<br>※The “adventurer in need” reward applies to the role in demand when registering for this duty.<br>※Joining this duty as a party meeting minimum size requirements will nullify any “adventurer in need” bonus.<br>
#. column 4: Duty Type: Light Party Dungeons & Trials
msgctxt "ContentRoulette:1:0:0"
msgid "Duty Roulette: Leveling"
msgstr "Рулетка активностей: прокачка"

#. ja: レベリング
#. de: Stufensteigerung
#. fr: Gain de niveaux
#. column 0: Duty Roulette: Leveling
#. column 3: A dungeon or trial will be selected at random from among those you have unlocked. Successful completion will earn you far greater rewards.<br><br>※Bonus EXP and gil will be awarded to compensate for the discrepancy between character and duty levels. A further percentage will then be added based on character level.<br>※The amount of bonus company seals awarded is determined by class/job level.<br>※The standard reward for this duty roulette category and all related bonuses are available once per day. Reward eligibility resets at <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time) each day.<br>※The “adventurer in need” reward applies to the role in demand when registering for this duty.<br>※Joining this duty as a party meeting minimum size requirements will nullify any “adventurer in need” bonus.<br>
#. column 4: Duty Type: Light Party Dungeons & Trials
msgctxt "ContentRoulette:1:0:1"
msgid "Leveling"
msgstr "Прокачка"

#. ja: 「コンテンツルーレット：レべリング」では、現在参加することのできるダンジョン、ライトパーティ用討伐戦の中から参加先がランダムに決定されます。さらに、個別にコンテンツを選択して参加したときよりも、大幅にプラスされたコンプリート報酬を得ることができます。<br><br>※「コンテンツルーレット：レべリング」の経験値とギルのボーナス値は、参加するクラス・ジョブのレベルによって決定され、参加先コンテンツの道中で得られる経験値、ギルとの差額を報酬として得られます。<br>※軍票の報酬量は参加するクラス・ジョブのレベルによって決定されます。<br>※「コンテンツルーレット」の報酬は1日1回のみ入手でき、取得状況は<reset-time 0><if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時にリセットされます。<br>※不足ロールボーナスは、コンテンツ申請時の不足ロールに対して適用されます。<br>※規定人数で参加した場合、不足ロールボーナスを得ることはできません。
#. de: Aus den freigeschalteten Dungeons und Prüfungen für Leichte Trupps wird ein Inhalt zufällig ausgewählt. Bei erfolgreichem Abschluss winkt eine Sondervergütung.<br><br>※ Die Höhe der Routine- und Gil-Sondervergütung richtet sich nach der Klassen- bzw. Jobstufe und entschädigt für die Differenz, die man für einen der Stufe angemessenen Inhalt erhalten hätte.<br>※ Die Höhe des Staatstaler-Bonus richtet sich nach der Klassen- bzw. Jobstufe.<br>※ Die Sondervergütung für Zufallsinhalte kann einmal pro Tag erhalten werden. Dieser Status wird täglich um <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr zurückgesetzt.<br>※ Der Bonus für gefragte Rollen ist immer erhältlich und bezieht sich auf die Rolle, die zum Zeitpunkt der Registrierung gefragt ist.<br>※ Bei Teilnahme als bestehende Gruppe wird kein Bonus für gefragte Rollen gewährt.
#. fr: Cette option sélectionne aléatoirement une mission parmi les donjons et défis pour petite équipe auxquels vous avez accès, avec une plus grande récompense en cas de réussite.<br><br>* Le bonus d'expérience et de gils est basé sur le niveau de la classe ou du job avec lequel vous participez, et ce qui aura été reçu au cours de la mission y sera soustrait.<br>* Le nombre de sceaux de grande compagnie reçu dépend du niveau de la classe ou du job.<br>* La récompense de mission aléatoire est limitée à une fois par jour. Le compteur est réinitialisé tous les jours à <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).<br>* Le bonus de rôle en nombre insuffisant est attribué en fonction des rôles manquants lors de l'enregistrement.<br>* Le bonus de rôle en nombre insuffisant n'est pas attribué dans le cas d'une petite équipe déjà formée.
#. column 0: Duty Roulette: Leveling
#. column 1: Leveling
#. column 4: Duty Type: Light Party Dungeons & Trials
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <reset-time 0> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "ContentRoulette:1:0:3"
msgid "A dungeon or trial will be selected at random from among those you have unlocked. Successful completion will earn you far greater rewards.<br><br>※Bonus EXP and gil will be awarded to compensate for the discrepancy between character and duty levels. A further percentage will then be added based on character level.<br>※The amount of bonus company seals awarded is determined by class/job level.<br>※The standard reward for this duty roulette category and all related bonuses are available once per day. Reward eligibility resets at <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time) each day.<br>※The “adventurer in need” reward applies to the role in demand when registering for this duty.<br>※Joining this duty as a party meeting minimum size requirements will nullify any “adventurer in need” bonus.<br>"
msgstr "Случайным образом выбирается подземелье или испытание из числа открытых вами. За успешное прохождение вы получите гораздо более щедрую награду.<br><br>※ Бонус к опыту и гилам компенсирует разницу между уровнем персонажа и уровнем задания. Кроме того, размер бонуса зависит от уровня персонажа.<br>※ Размер бонуса к печатям великой компании зависит от уровня класса или профессии.<br>※ Стандартную награду за эту рулетку и все связанные с ней бонусы можно получить раз в день. Право на награду обновляется ежедневно в <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>вечера<else>утра</if> по земному времени.<br>※ Бонус «Искатель приключений» зависит от роли, которой не хватает при подаче заявки.<br>※ При вступлении в задание заранее собранной группой минимального размера бонус «Искатель приключений» не предоставляется.<br>"

