#. column 3: A 24-member alliance raid will be selected at random from among those you have unlocked. Successful completion will earn you far greater rewards.<br><br>※Bonus EXP and gil will be awarded to compensate for the discrepancy between character and duty levels. A further percentage will then be added based on character level.<br>※The standard reward for this duty roulette category and all related bonuses are available once per day. Reward eligibility resets at <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time) each day.<br>※The “adventurer in need” reward applies to the role in demand when registering for this duty.
